fish-research-scanner-no-server = No working research server is connected. Use the scanner in hand to select a server.
fish-research-scanner-no-sample = No new eligible measurements. Check the experiment conditions at a research console.
fish-research-scanner-measurement-invalid = Measurement discarded: the target, server connection or experiment conditions changed.
fish-research-scanner-scan-complete = Measurement recorded. Experiments advanced: { $count }.
fish-research-scanner-anomaly-readings = Severity: { $severity }%. Instability: { $stability }%. Integrity: { $health }%.
